<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 TESALONIG</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 WAA TESALONIG</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bataaxal bu jëkk bi Yàlla may Pool, <optbreak /> mu bind ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAA TESALONIG</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Nun Pool, Silwan ak Timote noo ngi leen di bind, yéen mbooloom ñi gëm ci dëkku Tesalonig te nekk ci Yàlla Baay bi ak Boroom bi Yeesu Kirist. Yal na yiw ak jàmm ànd ak yéen.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li xibaaru jàmm bi jur ci dëkku Tesalonig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Bët bu set nu ngi sant Yàlla ndax yéen, di leen boole ci sunuy ñaan. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Dunu noppee fàttaliku ci kanam Yàlla sunu Baay jëf ji juddu ci seen ngëm, liggéey bi tukkee ci seen mbëggeel, ak muñ gi sosoo ci seen yaakaar ci sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Bokk yi, yéen ñi Yàlla bëgg, xam nanu ne Yàlla tànn na leen; <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ndaxte xibaaru jàmm, bi nu leen doon yégal, yemul woon ci ay wax rekk, waaye àndoon na ak kàttan ak Xel mu Sell mi ak kóolute gu mag. Xam ngeen sunu taxawaay ci seen biir ngir seen njariñ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Aw ngeen sunuy tànk ak yu Boroom bi, ci li ngeen nangu xibaar bi ci biir fitna yu metti, ànd ak mbég ci dooley Xel mu Sell mi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Noonu ngeen daldi nekk royukaay ngir ñi gëm ñépp ci diiwaani Maseduwan ak Akayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ndaxte kàddug Boroom bi jollee na ci seen biir, te yemul ci Maseduwan ak Akayi rekk, waaye seen gëm Yàlla siiw na fépp. Matul sax nu di ci wax dara, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />ndaxte ñoom ci seen bopp ñooy seede li sunu ngan def ci seen biir. Maanaam, ni ngeen dëddoo xërëm yi, jublu ci Yàlla te di ko jaamu, moom miy Yàlla Aji Dund ju dëggu ji, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />te ngeen di séentu Doomam bàyyikoo asamaan, moom Yeesu mi mu dekkal te di nu musal ci merum Yàlla mi nara ñëw.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ni leen Pool ganee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Waaw, bokk yi, xam ngeen ne ngan gi nu leen ganesi woon du nganug neen. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Laata nuy ñëw, jaar nanu ci fitna ak toroxte ca dëkku Filib, ni ngeen ko xame; waaye Yàlla sunu Boroom may na nu fit, ba li tongoonte bi metti lépp it, yégal nanu leen xibaaru jàmm bu Yàlla bi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ndaxte sunu waaraate wéeruwul cig réer walla ci njublaŋ walla ciy nax. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Waaye gannaaw Yàlla moo nu seet, ba wóolu nu te dénk nu xibaaru jàmm bi, kon noonu lanuy waaree, du ngir neex nit ñi, waaye ngir neex Yàlla miy seet xol yi.<verse eid="1TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Masunoo jay kenn, yéen xam ngeen ko; sunu waare masula ëmb bëgge, Yàlla seede na ko; <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />masunoo sàkku ngërëmu nit, muy ci yéen, muy ci ñeneen. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Manoon nanoo diis ci seen kaw sax, nun ñiy ndawi Kirist, waaye woyofoon nanu ci seen biir, te lewet ni jaboot buy uuf doomam. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Cofeel gi nu am ci yéen tax na, bëggunu woona yem ci xamal leen xibaaru jàmm bu Yàlla bi, waaye jox leen it sunu bakkan, ndaxte sunu xol seeyoon na ci yéen. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Bokk yi, yéena ngi fàttaliku sunu coono ak sunu ñaq; xam ngeen ni nu liggéeye guddi ak bëccëg, ngir baña diis ci seen kaw, ci di leen yégal xibaaru Yàlla.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Naka sunu diggante ak yéen ñi gëm, doxal nanu ko doxalin wu sell te jub te amul sikk: seede ngeen ko, te Yàlla it seede na ko. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11-12" />Xam ngeen ne dénk nanu leen kenn-kenn, ni baay di def ak doomam, dëfalal leen seen xol te dëggal ci yéen, ngeen dund dund gu neex Yàlla, moom mi leen di woo, ngeen séddu ci nguuram ak ndamam.<verse eid="1TH 2:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Te it dunu noppee sant Yàlla ci lii: ba ngeen jotee kàddug Yàlla, gi nu doon waare, nangu ngeen ko, waxuma ni kàddug nit waaye ni kàddug Yàlla, ndaxte moom la ci dëgg-dëgg, te mu ngi jëf ci yéen ñi gëm. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ndaxte bokk yi, aw ngeen ci tànki mboolooy Yàlla, yi nekk ca réewu Yawut ya tey daje ci turu Kirist Yeesu; fitna ya ñu daj ca Yawut ya, yéen it seen waa réew teg nañu leen ko. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Ñoom Yawut yi rey nañu Boroom bi Yeesu, ni ñu reye woon yonent yi; teg nañu nu fitna yu metti; neexuñu Yàlla, ànduñu ak kenn, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />di nu teree wax ak ñi dul Yawut, ngir bañ ñu mucc. Duñu noppee xuus ci biir bàkkaar, waaye merum Yàlla xëppu na ci seen kaw.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéeneb Pool ngir gis leen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nun nag bokk yi, ba ñu ma leen xañee ab diir --xol yi taxul may wax, waaye jëmm yi rekk-- jéem nanu leena gis ak sunu kem kàttan, ndax namm nanu leen, ba sunu xol seey ci gis leen. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Kon jàppoon nanu leena seetsi-- man Pool sax ay yooni yoon, waaye Seytaane téq na ma. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ndaxte bés bu Yeesu sunu Boroom délsee, te nu fekke ko, kan mooy sunu yaakaar? Kan mooy sunu mbég? Kan mooy sunu kaala, gi nuy tiitaroo? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Xanaa du yéen? Waaw, yéenay sunu ndam, yéenay sunu mbég.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Kon nag, ba nu ko manatula dékku, nangu nanu ñu bàyyi nu, nun doŋŋ, ca dëkku Aten, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />te yónni nanu Timote, sunu mbokk ak sunu nawle ci liggéeyu Yàlla ak ci waareb xibaaru Kirist. Yónni nanu ko, ngir mu dénk leen, tey feddali seen ngëm, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />ngir kenn baña raf ndax nattu, yi ngeen di jaar. Yéen ci seen bopp xam ngeen ne nattu mooy sunu cér. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ba nu nekkee ak yéen sax, waxoon nanu leen, waxati ko ne fàww nu sonn; te noonu la ame, yéen xam ngeen ko. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Noonu ba ma ko manatula dékku, yónnee naa, ngir xam fu seen ngëm tollu, ngir ragal Seytaane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seytaane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maanaam fiirkat bi.</char></note> fiir leen, ba sunu ñaq neen.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Waaye léegi Timote bawoo na ci yéen, indaale xibaar yu neex ci seen ngëm ak seen mbëggeel; xamal na nu ne yéena ngi am pàttaliku yu rafet ci nun te namm nu lool, ni nu leen namme, yéen itam. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Noonu bokk yi, ci biir tiis ak coono yi nu nekk, seen ngëm dëfal na sunu xol. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ndaxte noo ngi dund dëgg-dëgg, ndegam yéena ngi sax ci Boroom bi. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ndaw cant yu bare yu nu wara sant Yàlla ndax yéen! Ndaw mbég mu bare, mi nu am ci kanamam ndax yéen! <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Guddi ak bëccëg nu ngi wàkkirlu ci ñaan Yàlla may nu nu gis leen, ba mana mottali seen ngëm.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Yal na Yàlla sunu Baay moom ci boppam ak Yeesu sunu Boroom jubal sunu yoon ci yéen. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Yal na leen Boroom bi dolli mbëggeel gu tar, ngeen bëggante te bëgg ñépp, ni nu leen bëgge nun. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Yal na Boroom bi samp seeni xol noonu ci sellaay gu amul sikk fa kanam Yàlla sunu Baay, ba bés bu Yeesu sunu Boroom délsee, ànd ak gaayam yu sell yépp.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Pool xiir na leen cig sell</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Léegi nag bokk yi, jot ngeen ci nun, nan ngeen wara dunde ba neex Yàlla, te moom ngeen di def. Waaye ci turu Boroom bi Yeesu nu ngi leen di ñaan ak a dénk, ngeen gën koo feddali. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ndaxte xam ngeen ndigal, yi nu leen jox ci wàllu Yeesu Boroom bi. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Lii nag mooy coobarey Yàlla: ngeen sell, maanaam ngeen moytu njaaloo; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />ngeen not seeni cér ci cell ak tedd, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />te xemmem bañ leena jiital, ni xeeti àddina yi xamul Yàlla. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Ci mbir mii nag, bu kenn ci yéen laal yëfi jaambur, ngir bañ koo tooñ. Ndaxte waxoon nanu leen bu yàgg te artu leen ne, ñiy def loolu, Boroom bi dina leen mbugal. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ndaxte Yàlla woo na nu, nu dund ci cell, waaye du ci sobe. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ku tanqamlu wax jii nag, defoo ko nit, Yàlla nga ko def, moom mi leen di jox Xel mu Sell mi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ci lu jëm ci bëggante ci seen biir, matul nu leen di bind dara, ndaxte Yàlla def na ci seen xol, ngeen bëggante. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Te moom ngeen di def ci bokk yépp, yi ci diiwaanu Maseduwan. Waaye bokk yi, maa ngi leen di xiirtal, ngeen gën cee sax. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Fullawooleena dund ci jàmm, di topptoo seen mbiri bopp tey lekk seen ñaq, ni nu leen ko sante woon. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Noonu dingeen dund dund gu jekk ci kanam waa àddina, te it dungeen soxlaal kenn dara.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndekkitel ñi dee ak bésu Boroom bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ci mbirum ñi nelaw nag bokk yi, bëgguñu ngeen réere mbir, ba tiis ni aji gëmul, yi amul benn yaakaar. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ndegam gëm nanu ne Yeesu dee na te dekki, noonu it Yàlla dina indaale ak Yeesu ñépp ñi ko gëm te nelaw.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Nu ngi leen di wax lii tukkee ci Boroom bi: nun ñiy dund te des fi, ba kera Boroom biy délsi, dunu jiitu ñi nelaw. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ndaxte ndigal lu jamp dina jib, baatu kilifa ci malaaka yi dégtu, liitu Yàlla jolli, te Boroom bi moom ci boppam dina wàcce ca asamaan. Booba ñi gëm Kirist te dee dinañu jëkka dekki; <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />gannaaw loolu nun ñiy dund te des fi, dinañu ne fëyy ak ñoom jëm ci niir yi, taseji ak Boroom bi ci jaww ji. Te noonu dinanu nekk ak Boroom bi ba fàww. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Kon nag na ku nekk di dëfal sa xolu moroom ak kàddu yooyu.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Waaye bokk yi, ci li jëm ci jamono yi ak waxtu, yi loolu di am, matul nu leen ciy bind dara. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Ndaxte xam ngeen bu wér ne ni sàcc di ñëwe guddi, noonu la bésu Boroom bi di ñëwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Fekk nit ñiy naan: «Lépp a ngi ci jàmm, ba ne leww,» booba musiba bett leen, ni aw mat di bette jigéenu biir, te kenn du ci mucc. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Waaye yéen bokk yi, nekkuleen cig lëndëm, ba tax bés boobu bett leen ni sàcc. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ndaxte yéen ñépp ci leer ak bëccëg ngeen bokk; bokkunu ci guddi ak lëndëm. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Kon nag bunu nelaw ni ñeneen ñi, waaye nanu xool te maandu. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ndaxte ñiy nelaw, guddi lañuy nelaw, te ñiy màndi, guddi lañuy màndi. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Waaye nun ñiy waa bëccëg, nanu maandu te ràngoo ngir xare bi: ngëm ak mbëggeel, muy kiiraayu dënn, ak kóoluteg mucc, muy mbaxanam xare. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ndaxte Yàlla jaglewu nu meram, waaye mucc la nu jagleel ndax darajay sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Deeyal na nu, ngir nu mana dund ak moom, bu nu nelawee ak bu nu nelawagul. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Kon nag nangeen dëgëralante te yokkante seen ngëm, ni ngeen koy defe.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dénkaane yu mujj yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Gannaaw loolu bokk yi, ci lu jëm ci njiit, yi Boroom bi teg ci seen kanam te ñuy liggéey ci seen biir, di leen artu, maa ngi leen di ñaan ngeen déglu leen; <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />rax-ca-dolli ngeen naw leen seen kem kàttan te bëgg leen ndax seen liggéey. Na jàmm am ci seen biir. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Bokk yi, nu ngi leen di dénk, ngeen yedd ñi feñaag, dëfal ñi seen yasara yàcciku, dimbali ñi néew doole, tey muñal ñépp. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Saxleen ci baax ci seen biir ak ci ñépp, te baña feyantoo. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Deeleen bég <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />te sax ciy ñaan Yàlla, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />di ko gërëm ci lépp, ndaxte loolu mooy coobarey Yàlla ci yéen ci seen bokk ci Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Buleen fey taalu Xelum Yàlla, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />di xeeb waxu yonent yi. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Waaye seetleen mbir yépp, jàpp ci li baax, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />dëddu lépp lu ci bon.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Yal na leen Yàlla miy Boroom jàmm sellal, ba ngeen mat sëkk; yal na sàmm seen xel mépp, seen xol bépp ak seen yaram wépp, ngir dara bañ cee am sikk, ba bés bu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist délsee. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Yàlla, mi leen woo ci loolu, kuy sàmm kóllëre la, te dina ko def.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tàggoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Bokk yi, buleen nu fàtte ci seeni ñaan.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Nuyul-leen nu bokk yépp ak saafoonte bu laab. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Maa ngi leen di dénk ci kanam Boroom bi, ngeen jàngal bataaxal bii bokk yépp.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Yal na yiwu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist ànd ak yéen.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>